{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to","id":1551602,"title":"Musicians that you like to listen to","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-06-11T17:38:01-07:00","id":1551602,"title":"Musicians that you like to listen to","content":"Myself I try to have a wide range of bands that I like to listen to.<br /> <br /> But I go out of my way for Linkin Park, Rob Zombie, P!NK, Carrie Underwood, David Bowie, Jason Aldean, Shania Twain, Lindsey Ellis, Ozzy Osbourne and recently Ghost.<br /> <br /> What people do you like to listen to the most?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-12T16:10:45-07:00","id":1551639,"title":"","content":"Sounds like you like some great music!<br /> <br /> I listen to a ton of stuff, but I guess lately I've been listing to Ghost (that new Album is great), The Lumineers, Of Monsters and Men, Sleater-Kinney, Amyl and the Sniffers... the list could go on. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-15T15:15:13-07:00","id":1551692,"title":"","content":"I like finding new music; sure, there's some old stuff I like, but at times, I like finding what else is out there. And there are times I just want to listen to what I want to listen to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-19T04:24:15-07:00","id":1551764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1551692#post1551692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like finding new music; sure, there's some old stuff I like, but at times, I like finding what else is out there. And there are times I just want to listen to what I want to listen to.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm with you. I do try to find some new music when I can, but I do find that sometimes I just listen to the same few albums or songs over and over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-19T17:14:11-07:00","id":1551776,"title":"","content":"My taste in music is all over the place and mostly leans towards older stuff.<br /> <br /> I'm that weird dude who not only still listens to music on an MP3 player but said MP3 player has Linkin Park, Limp Bizkit, My Chemical Romance, Black Sabbath, Eminem, NWA, Geto Boys, Creedence Clearwater Revival, Tommy Wright III, Maniac, early Three Six Mafia, Waylon Jennings, Hikaru Otada, Insane Clown Posse, Mayhem, Bathory, Hawthorne Heights, Dave Rodgers, Giorgio Moroder, The Stanley Brothers, Lady Gaga, Ozzy Osbourne, Rob Zombie, Johnny Cash, The Dillards, 2 Live Crew, Chappell Roan, Children of the Corn, Ghost, Megadeth, Green Day, Beastie Boys, Nine Inch Nails, Gangstagrass, The Ramones, Evanesence, Backstreet Boys, and Marilyn Manson. And a lot of tracks from PS1 and PS2 games.<br /> <br /> No joke, my MP3 player's playlists will give a music snob headaches and nightmares.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":25920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","user":"Matt Corleone","date":". 06-25-2025, 06:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-20T04:43:23-07:00","id":1551783,"title":"","content":"I mostly listen to video game music and songs from movies and cartoons. When it comes to artists that I listen with some regularity, though, it's more Brazilian musicians from the time of the dictatorship, before I was even born, like Caetano Veloso, Chico Buarque and Raul Seixas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-10T01:24:36-08:00","id":1557442,"title":"","content":"Sadly, it's becoming increasingly more difficult to find any new artists these days, with all the A.I slop taking the internet by storm. Everything looks like it's made by the same artist, and sounds like it's sung by the same vocalist.<br /> <br /> So I turn to the classics. Metallica, Iron Maiden, Sabaton, Powerwolf, Ozzy Osbourne, Dio, Gloryhammer, Angus McSix, Godsmack, Five Finger Deathpunch, and a few others who's names currently slip my memory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-10T18:34:49-08:00","id":1557459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1557442#post1557442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly, it's becoming increasingly more difficult to find any new artists these days, with all the A.I slop taking the internet by storm. Everything looks like it's made by the same artist, and sounds like it's sung by the same vocalist.. . .</div> </div> </div> </div>Now, AI can be good, if you're composing music. But, if you're letting it do ALL the work, it's kinda a waste of human-en-devour. If you've got knowledge of composing-music, using AI makes sense if you can't get musicians. <br /> <br /> Another trap of AI, is that, a good tune, is a good tune. You can't deny it; It's like going down the primrose-path. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1551783#post1551783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mostly listen to video game music and songs from movies and cartoons.. . .</div> </div> </div> </div>Sega Saturn's Doom Score was good; sadly, this seems to be his best work:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ij2EH_j9H3A?si=5Do8TH2wn54pC5zy\" data-code=\"ij2EH_j9H3A\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ij2EH_j9H3A/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-11T04:14:49-08:00","id":1557465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1557459#post1557459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now, AI can be good, if you're composing music. But, if you're letting it do ALL the work, it's kinda a waste of human-en-devour. If you've got knowledge of composing-music, using AI makes sense if you can't get musicians.<br /> <br /> Another trap of AI, is that, a good tune, is a good tune. You can't deny it; It's like going down the primrose-path.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm waiting for the AI bubble to burst once everybody gets bored of it.<br /> <br /> It happened with Auto Tune, and that one actually required humans to put forth a modicum of effort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-14T14:53:53-08:00","id":1557620,"title":"","content":"My tastes tend 