lass=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_NMtp_9Ehyo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1557620#post1557620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My tastes tend to be a bit eclectic. Alice Cooper (both as a band and a solo artist), David Bowie, Johnny Cash, Madonna (mostly her earlier stuff), The Cult, Living Colour, Concrete Blonde, Roxette, Public Enemy, Iggy Pop, Billy Idol, Adam Ant, The Go-Gos (including their solo stuff), Prince, Michael Jackson, Accept, Fozzy, Mott the Hoople, Tom Petty, Tori Amos, Black Sabbath, Van Halen, Type O Negative, Tina Turner, Cyndi Lauper, The Rolling Stones, Fine Young Cannibals, The Cure, The Who, Creedence Clearwater Revival, Lady Gaga, Pat Benatar, Tom Jones, Nick Cave, Mathew Sweet, Bruce Willis, Warlock, Cinderella, Brian Setzer, Stevie Nicks, Stevie Ray Vaughn, Whitney Houston, En Vogue, The Bee Gees, Stevie Wonder, Iron Maiden, Eminem, Marilyn Manson (mainly covers of other artists), Queen, and dozens of others.</div> </div> </div> </div>That reminds me; I'm going to make a Pirate Radio 100.3 playlist on my phone of all the old-songs I used to record on tapes off the radio back in the day. And most of my coworkers at my many jobs came of age or was in college in the late '70's / early '80's. So, the '70's playlist, that I hand picked from my various sources, they dug; the one in which I just threw ALL '70's songs, from all my sources, they didn't like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-13T10:40:47-08:00","id":1558290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1551602-musicians-that-you-like-to-listen-to?p=1557620#post1557620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My tastes tend to be a bit eclectic. Alice Cooper (both as a band and a solo artist), David Bowie, Johnny Cash, Madonna (mostly her earlier stuff), The Cult, Living Colour, Concrete Blonde, Roxette, Public Enemy, Iggy Pop, Billy Idol, Adam Ant, The Go-Gos (including their solo stuff), Prince, Michael Jackson, Accept, Fozzy, Mott the Hoople, Tom Petty, Tori Amos, Black Sabbath, Van Halen, Type O Negative, Tina Turner, Cyndi Lauper, The Rolling Stones, Fine Young Cannibals, The Cure, The Who, Creedence Clearwater Revival, Lady Gaga, Pat Benatar, Tom Jones, Nick Cave, Mathew Sweet, Bruce Willis, Warlock, Cinderella, Brian Setzer, Stevie Nicks, Stevie Ray Vaughn, Whitney Houston, En Vogue, The Bee Gees, Stevie Wonder, Iron Maiden, Eminem, Marilyn Manson (mainly covers of other artists), Queen, and dozens of others.</div> </div> </div> </div>You sir, are a man of great musical taste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-13T18:03:09-08:00","id":1558303,"title":"","content":"Cool guy I came across this week<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K4k1t1Misrk\" data-code=\"K4k1t1Misrk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/K4k1t1Misrk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24473-willowfang","name":"Willowfang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24473_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-13T20:58:31-08:00","id":1558307,"title":"","content":"Folk Metal from var